{
  "version": 1,
  "name": "Example: Thermostat",
  "exampleId": "block-thermostat",
  "description": "The room is a 1000 J/K heat capacity losing heat to 20 °C outside through 2 W/K. The on-off controller turns the heater on below the set point minus half its 2 K band and off above it plus half, so after warming up for about 7 minutes the temperature cycles between 49 °C and 51 °C. Boolean to real scales the on command into 100 W of heat.",
